---
mm: 1.2
kind: sdk
name: pico-riscv
target: riscv32-pico-elf
compiler-family: gcc
runtime: newlib
library: pico-sdk
provides: reset-vector
provides: initial-stack
provides: memory-layout
provides: runtime-init
provides: syscalls
---

# Pico SDK, RP2350 RISC-V

Selects RP2350's Hazard3 cores. riscv32-pico-elf is the first triple Pico SDK
itself prefers, ahead of riscv32-unknown-elf, riscv32-corev-elf, and
riscv-none-elf. The external SDK build owns the link, so this SDK declares
neither a specs profile nor a specs file and owns all five responsibilities.
